KAPASA MAKASA UNIVERSITY (KMU)

General Information

Kapasa Makasa University (KMU) is a public university in Zambia.

Location: Chinsali District, Muchinga Province, Zambia.

KMU provides university education and training in different academic fields.

Important Information for Applicants

Students interested in applying should:

1. Visit the official KMU website for current admission announcements.
2. Check the available academic programmes.
3. Read the admission requirements.
4. Follow the official application instructions.
5. Confirm application fees and deadlines before making payments.

Important Notice

Admission requirements, application fees, programmes and deadlines may change.

ASK MR TEES must not invent admission information.

When information is unavailable or outdated, direct applicants to the official KMU website:

https://www.kmu.ac.zm/

Students should also check official university communication channels for new announcements.
